able': False, 'views': {'count': '254562', 'state': 'EnabledWithCount'}, 'source': '<a href="http://twitter.com/download/iphone" rel="nofollow">Twitter for iPhone</a>', 'note_tweet': {'is_expandable': True, 'note_tweet_results': {'result': {'id': 'Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjE4ODIyNDkyNzkwOTc3NjU4ODg=', 'text': 'It turns out that OpenAI does NOT have the money to invest into the Stargate project according to Elon Musk.\n\nGuess who does…\n\nMicrosoft.\n\nHere is Microsoft CEO Satya Nadalla at WEF Davos bragging about how Microsoft is still going to fund Stargate to the tune of $80 Billion even if OpenAI can’t pay it.\n\nHmm, that is REALLY interesting…\n\nDid you know that Microsoft OWNS roughly 50% of OpenAI?\n\nHere is where it gets really interesting…\n\nWho remembers back in 2019 when Microsoft patented WO2020060606 (666) prior to the drop of the COVID jabs?\n\nThat is for a patent that allows for Cryptocurrency to be used as a kind of “reward system” for the human body.\n\n“Human body activity associated with a task provided to a user may be used in a mining process of a cryptocurrency system. A server may provide a task to a device of a user which is communicatively coupled to the server. A sensor communicatively coupled to or comprised in the device of the user may sense body activity of the user. Body activity data may be generated based on the sensed body activity of the user. The cryptocurrency system communicatively coupled to the device of the user may verify if the body activity data satisfies one or more conditions set by the cryptocurrency system, and award cryptocurrency to the user whose body activity data is verified.”\n\nEssentially, it’s a patent that awards a Crypto reward of some kind to the user who “verifies” their body activity data, including vital signs, heat signatures, and certain movements.\n\nSounds EXTREMELY “Mark of the Beast” like. \n\nIf that doesn’t sound sketchy enough, the way that this system will work is via mRNA nanoparticles and Graphene Oxide, which were in the COVID jabs, and will surely be in the “AI cancer vaccines”.\n\nThat is the whole reason they WANT us to get jabbed. It will play a big part when the Mark is ready for a mass rollout.\n\nNow, we MUST ask why there is a sudden partnership (Stargate) between Larry Ellison, and Sam Altman. Both of which are tech bro Globalists, pushing Artificial Super Intelligence, mass surveillance, mRNA cancer vaccines. All are hallmarks of the World Economic Forum’s push for total AI Governance, which will lead us directly into the One World Government system lead by the Antichrist.\n\nThe evidence that mRNA is made to KILL, and or transform the body God gave you into transhuman is incontrovertible, concise, and VERY well documented.\n\nI will say, if @realDonaldTrump wants us to expose this, we should take EVERY opportunity to do so, because the future of humanity literally depends on it.\n\nOr, if that is the true intention and we are going into an AI ruled world, then get close to Jesus because His return is imminent.\n\nYou can come to your own conclusions here, as I would always encourage every one to do, but the signs are now unavoidable, and directly in our faces. \n\nI come to you from a Biblical perspective.\n\nI don’t share this information out of fear, but rather as a matter of preparation for the inevitable. ￼', 'entity_set': {'hashtags': [], 'symbols': [], 'urls': [], 'user_mentions': [{'id_str': '25073877', 'name': 'Donald J. Trump', 'screen_name': 'realDonaldTrump', 'indices': [2438, 2454]}]}}}}, 'quotedRefResult': {'result': {'__typename': 'Tweet', 'rest_id': '1881837202037940704'}}, 'legacy': {'bookmark_count': 481, 'bookmarked': False, 'created_at': 'Thu Jan 23 02:09:33 +0000 2025', 'conversation_id_str': '1882249279513002372', 'display_text_range': [0, 275], 'entities': {'hashtags': [], 'media': [{'display_url': 'pic.x.com/01iY9ZpJYK', 'expanded_url': 'https://x.com/TPV_John/status/1882249279513002372/video/1', 'id_str': '18822491993259540